<title>UK: Paribas sets warrants on a Russian Telecom basket.</title>
<headline>Paribas sets warrants on a Russian Telecom basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas Capital Markets Group Ltd has issued 30,000 European-style call warrants, in six equal tranches, on a Russian Telecom basket, lead manager Paribas said.</p>
<p>The basket includes 750 shares of Rostetecom, one share of Moscow City Telecom, 409 shares of Saint-Petersburg Telephone, 9,771 shares of Uralsvyazinform, 11 shares of Kubanelektrosvyas, two shares of Samarasvyazinform and five shares of Chelyabinskvyazinform. All shares in the bassket are listed in Moscow.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> CLOSING DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT FIVE</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p>		STRIKE (US$)    ISSUE (US$)  EXPIRY DATE</p>
<p>TRANCHE A   $9,000	    $2025	  08.JUL.98</p>
<p>TRANCHE B   $11,000	   $1495	  08.JUL.98</p>
<p>TRANCHE C   $13,000	   $1115	  08.JUL.98</p>
<p>TRANCHE D   $10,000	   $2790	  08.JUL.99</p>
<p>TRANCHE E   $13,000	   $2170	  08.JUL.99</p>
<p>TRANCHE F   $16,000	   $1730	  08.JUL.99</p>
<p>NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   PARIBASB</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
